	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ge-bȳsnian" d:title="ge-bȳsnian">
		<body>
			<h1>ge-bȳsnian<span class="pron"> | je.byː.sni.ɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ge-bisnian" class="xref-target">ge-bisnian</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="HĀLI" d:title="HĀLI">
		<body>
			<h1>HĀLI<span class="pron"> | xɑː.li |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Health, salvation</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:HǢLU" class="xref-target">HǢLU</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="bān" d:title="bān">
		<body>
			<h1>bān<span class="pron"> | bɑːn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol class="labeled">
				<li>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Bān os</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. i. 44, 22: 70, 46)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">I.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">bone</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Þū eart mīn bān and mīn flǣsc</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Gen. 29, 14: Ps. Th. 138, 13)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ne bān ne blōd</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Dōm. 40)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Þæt gafol bið on hwales bāne</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ors. 1, 1; S. 18, 17)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hiē habbað swīþe æþele bān on hiora tōþum</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (17, 36)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">tange os ejus et carnem</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Hrepa his bān and his flǣsc</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. Th. ii. 452, 19: Ph. 221)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
					<ol class="sub-senses labeled">
						<li>
							<p>
								<span class="sense-label">I a.</span>
								<span class="sub-heading">of other hard material</span>
							</p>
							<ul class="quotes">
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Siō ecg gewāc on bāne (the hide of the firedrake)</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (B. 2578)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Wæter wearð tō bāne (ice)</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Rä. 68, 3)</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</li>
					</ol>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">II.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">a bone</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Bānes byrst</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Th. 108, 18: Gū. 670)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Gīf man findeð ān bān unforbærned</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ors. 1, 1; S. 21, 12)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Gif hwā mid his fēt ofstepð ǣttrig bān snacan oððe nǣddran</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Lch. i. 152, 2)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hwǣr sint nū þæs Wēlondes bān?</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Bt. 19; F. 70, 5)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ne synu ne bān lāgon</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (An. 1421)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Þā gebrocenan bān</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. C. 81: Hy. 7, 88)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">ossuum</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Bāna ossuum</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Kent. Gl. 571: Ph. 575)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">ossa hominum</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Manna bān</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Th. 52, 6)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Bānu handlian</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Lch. iii. 208, 24)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
					<ol class="sub-senses labeled">
						<li>
							<p>
								<span class="sense-label">II a.</span>
								<span class="sub-heading">the bone of a limb, a leg or arm</span>
							</p>
							<ul class="quotes">
								<li>
									<span class="q-en">their limbs failed them</span>
									<span class="q-oe">Bān weornedon</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Sat. 468)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-la">coxarum</span>
									<span class="q-oe">Bāna coxarum</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 17, 66: 75, 27)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Wǣron þā bendas forburnene, þā him on bānum lāgon</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Dan. 435)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Fȳrdraca heals ealne ymbefēng biteran bānum</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (B. 2692)</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</li>
					</ol>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:heāfod-bān" class="xref-target">heāfod-bān</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:hleōr-bān" class="xref-target">hleōr-bān</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:hring-bān" class="xref-target">hring-bān</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:scin-bān" class="xref-target">scin-bān</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:sweor-bān" class="xref-target">sweor-bān</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:wiþo-bān" class="xref-target">wiþo-bān</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:bān-beorg" class="xref-target">bān-beorg</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:bān-gebeorg" class="xref-target">bān-gebeorg</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:bān-rift" class="xref-target">bān-rift</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="mōtian" d:title="mōtian">
		<body>
			<h1>mōtian<span class="pron"> | moː.ti.ɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol class="labeled">
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">I.</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hī lange mōtodon</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. S. 34, 214 : 310: 36, 365)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">they heard a long conversation being carried on with Martin</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Þā gehȳrdon hī mōtian wið Martine lange</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (31, 694)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ge-mōtian" class="xref-target">ge-mōtian</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="folc-sōp" d:title="folc-sōp">
		<body>
			<h1>folc-sōp<span class="pron"> | folk.soːp |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">the plain truth (?)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">I say here before you all the plain and simple truth</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ic secge hēr beforan eōw eallum folcsðð</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Hml, S. 23, 666)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:folc-wōh" class="xref-target">folc-wōh</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ōs" d:title="ōs">
		<body>
			<h1>ōs<span class="pron"> | oːs |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">a divinity, god</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ōs byþ ordfruma ǣlcre sprǣce Wīsdōmes wraðu and witena frōfur And eorla gehwam eādnīs and tōhyht.</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Runic pm. Kmbl. 340, 5-10; Rūn. 4.)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Saga mē hwā ǣrost bōcstafas sette? Ic ðe secge Mercurius ( = Woden) se gygand.</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Salm. Kmbl. p. 192)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Gif hit wǣre ēsa gescot, oððe hit wǣre ylfa gescot, oððe hit wǣre hægtessan gescot, nū ic wille ðīn helpan. Ðis Ðis ðē tō bōte ēsa gescotes, &amp;c.</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Lchdm. iii. 54)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="mann-rīm" d:title="mann-rīm">
		
		<body>
			<h1>mann-rīm<span class="pron"> | mɑnn.riːm |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>neuter noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A number of men</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ðīnre mǣgþe monrīm</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Cd. 84; Th. 105, 35; Gen. 1763)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Monrīm mægeþ (mægþa?) a number of women (the Egyptian women spoken of before as freō and þeōwe)</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (131; Th. 166, 15; Gen. 2748)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hwæt ðǣr eallra wæs on manrīme ... deādra gefeallen</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Elen. Kmbl. 1296; El. 650)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="-healdlic" d:title="-healdlic">
