							<span class="q-en">if to any man there be a quartan fever incident</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Gif hwylcum men sȳ ðæs feōrþan dæges fefer getænge</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Herb. 2, 12; Lchdm. i. 84, 5, MS. B.)</span>
