<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="dynge" d:title="dynge">
		<body>
			<h1>dynge<span class="pron"> | dyn.Ge |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">a storm. Substitute: dynges mere?</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Gewitan him þā Norþmen nægledcnearrum on dinges (dynges, dyniges, dinnes, v. ll.) mere ofer deōp wæter Difelin sēcan</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Chr. 937; P. 109, 12)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
