						<span class="meaning-en">Easy to believe (?)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Se gewuna þisse hālgan drohtnunge þē gedēþ leāfleōht and eāþe þæt ðe ǣr earfoðe and ancsumlic þūhte</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (R. Ben. 5, 19)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ā-swēgan" d:title="ā-swēgan">
