			<h1>cealc<span class="pron"> | tʃæ͜ɑlk |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Calc calculus</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 102, 39)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Cealc</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (13, 6)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Byð gefylled mūð his mid cealce (calculo)</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Scint. 110, 14)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="helfe" d:title="helfe">
		<body>
			<h1>helfe<span class="pron"> | xel.fe |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Helve, handle</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hæft and helfe manubrium</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ælfc. Gl. 52; Som. 66, 31; Wrt. Voc. 35, 20)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Siō æcs āwient of ðæm hielfe ferrum lapsum de manubrio</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Past. 21, 7; Swt. 167, 1)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">I gathered me handles for each of the tools that I could work with</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Gaderode me hylfa tō ǣlcum ðara tōla ðe ic mid wircan cūðe</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Shrn. 163, 6)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="þeā" d:title="þeā">
