			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:stīpan to exalt" class="xref-target">stīpan to exalt</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="for-treddan" d:title="for-treddan">
		<body>
			<h1>for-treddan<span class="pron"> | for.tred.dɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">past: sg: -de</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">To tread down, destroy by treading</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">quasi maturam segetem obuia quaeque metunt, calcant, transeunt</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Swā swā rīpe yrð hī fortreddon and fornāmon and hī ealle foryrmdon</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Bd. 1, 12; Sch. 32, 22)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="fylgend-līce" d:title="fylgend-līce">
		<body>
			<h1>fylgend-līce<span class="pron"> | fyl.Gend.liː.tʃe |</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:æfter-fylgendlīce" class="xref-target">æfter-fylgendlīce</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="scīr-mǣled" d:title="scīr-mǣled">
		<body>
			<h1>scīr-mǣled<span class="pron"> | ʃiːr.mæː.led |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Brightly marked, bright with inlaid ornaments</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Scīrmǣled swyrd</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Judth. Thw. 24, 38; Jud. 230)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:māl-sweord" class="xref-target">māl-sweord</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ge-sceran" d:title="ge-sceran">
		<body>
			<h1>ge-sceran<span class="pron"> | je.ʃe.rɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol class="labeled">
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">I.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">to shear</span>
					</p>
					<ol class="sub-senses labeled">
						<li>
							<p>
								<span class="sense-label">(1)</span>
								<span class="meaning-en">to cut the hair off the head</span>
							</p>
							<ul class="quotes">
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Heāfod him beōn gescoren hearm getācnað</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Lch. iii. 200, 21)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Gesce(o)rene rasam</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (An. Ox. 56, 12)</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>
								<span class="sense-label">(2)</span>
								<span class="meaning-en">to cut the wool off sheep</span>
							</p>
							<ul class="quotes">
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Sceāp gesihð gescorene hȳnðe getācnað</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Lch. iii. 208, 26)</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</li>
					</ol>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">II.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">to cut through</span>
					</p>
					<ol class="sub-senses labeled">
						<li>
							<p>
								<span class="sense-label">(1)</span>
								<span class="sub-heading">of a person's action</span>
							</p>
							<ul class="quotes">
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Hē him on heāfde helm gescer, þæt hē blōde fāh būgan sceolde</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (B. 2973)</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>
								<span class="sense-label">(2)</span>
								<span class="sub-heading">of the operation of a weapon</span>
							</p>
							<ul class="quotes">
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Seō ecg geswāc þeōdne æt þearfe; þolode ǣr fela handgemōta, helm oft gescær</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (B. 1526)</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</li>
					</ol>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="hæg-sugga" d:title="hæg-sugga">
		<body>
			<h1>hæg-sugga<span class="pron"> | xæG.suɣ.gɑ |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -an</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A hedge-sparrow</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hægsugga. ficitula</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Hpt. 33, 241, 48)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:hege-sugge" class="xref-target">hege-sugge</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:sucga" class="xref-target">sucga</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="-ling" d:title="-ling">
		
		<body>
			<h1>-ling<span class="pron"> | ling |</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:bæc-ling" class="xref-target">bæc-ling</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:ears-ling" class="xref-target">ears-ling</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:hinder-ling" class="xref-target">hinder-ling</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:bæclinga" class="xref-target">bæclinga</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:grundlinga" class="xref-target">grundlinga</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:handleinga" class="xref-target">handleinga</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
