					<b>neuter noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A ship</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Of ȳðlide</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Andr. Kmbl. 555; An. 278)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ofer ȳðlid (-lið, MS.)</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (889; An. 445)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="heofon-cenned" d:title="heofon-cenned">
		
		<body>
			<h1>heofon-cenned<span class="pron"> | xe͜o.fon.Ken.ned |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Heaven-born</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">supra celigenas aetheris omnes</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ofer heofancennede roderes ealle</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Hy. S. 108, 9)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="weorold-bismer" d:title="weorold-bismer">
		<body>
			<h1>weorold-bismer<span class="pron"> | we͜o.rold.bi.smer |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Worldly reproach</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">per contumaciam</span>
							<span class="q-oe">For woroldbismere ānum</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Past. 10; Swt. 61, 10)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="flōde" d:title="flōde">
		<body>
			<h1>flōde<span class="pron"> | floː.de |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -an</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A place where anything flows, a channel, sink, gutter</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. cloāca, lăcūna)</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
