							<span class="q-oe">Aegmang agastrum</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 99, 55)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ǣg-gemang" class="xref-target">ǣg-gemang</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
