						<span class="meaning-en">After</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Swilce ne wæs oþ þis nū ne æftum ne weorþaþ</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Mt. R. 24, 21)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
