				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-la">obeuntem, morientem</span>
						<span class="q-oe">Forðfērende obeuntem, morientem</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Hpt. Gl. 501, 31)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Ðā ðe wǣron forðfērede for hund geārum oððon gyt firnor</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Wlfst. 96, 7)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
