				<p>
					<b>neuter noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Law, injunction of the law, command</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. lex, legis mandatum)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">tu legem posuisti mihi</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ðū me ǣbebod ǣrest settest</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Th. 118, 102)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
