						<span class="q-oe">Hē mid leōðlicum metre be þām mōnðum þus giddode</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Angl. viii. 301, 34)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="sealh-beorh" d:title="sealh-beorh">
