							<span class="q-oe">Seō sǣ getācnað þās andwerdan woruld þe mid mislicum gelimpum ðǣre sǣ swangetunge geefenlǣcð</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Nap. 60)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
