						<span class="q-oe">Fiscmere piscina (v. Jn. 5, 2)</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 74, II)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:fisc-pōl" class="xref-target">fisc-pōl</a>
