				<p>
					<b>neuter noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A lintel</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">ponent super utrumque postem et in superliminaribus domorum</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Smīton on ǣgðer gedyre and on ða ofergedyru</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ex. 12, 7)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
