<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="hosp-word" d:title="hosp-word">
		<body>
			<h1>hosp-word<span class="pron"> | xosp.word |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Sǣde se deōfol him hospword and mid manegum tālum hine tȳnde, ac hē næs gestirod for his leāsum tālum</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. S. 31, 723)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Se Hǣlend ðǣra Iūdēiscra hospword gehȳrde. . . . 'Wē oncnāwað þæt þū eart wōd,'</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. Th. ii. 232, 16)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
