			<h1>ge-rihtreccan<span class="pron"> | je.rix.trek.kɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">to direct</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">god to direct thee to see God with thy mind's eye</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ðē to gerihtrecenne ðæt ðū gesyhst myd ðīnes mōdes eāgan</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Shrn. 177, 25)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
