						<span class="q-oe">Tō beddreāfe genihtsumige tō hæbbenne meatte and hwītel</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (R. Ben. 90, 15)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-la">sago</span>
						<span class="q-oe">Hī ne mihton hine beran būton on ānum hwītle</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Gr. D. 125, 18)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Rūhne hwītel (printed Haken,</span>
