				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Divination</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. ariolorum)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">ariolorum</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ða ðæt womfreht rēniaþ</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 82, 8)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Womferht</span>
