						<span class="meaning-en">York</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Efer-wīc</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Chr. 188; Th. 15, 25, col. 3)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:Eofor-wīc" class="xref-target">Eofor-wīc</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="berst" d:title="berst">
