						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. pila)</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="under-sprecan" d:title="under-sprecan">
		<body>
			<h1>under-sprecan<span class="pron"> | un.der.spre.kɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">To speak under or beneath</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="wylcþ" d:title="wylcþ">
		<body>
			<h1>wylcþ<span class="pron"> | wylkθ |</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:welwan" class="xref-target">welwan</a>
			</p>
