			<h1>mæsse-gierela<span class="pron"> | mæs.se.Gi͜y.re.lɑ |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -an</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Vestment used at the celebration of the mass</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
