							<span class="q-la">abominationem</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Fram onāscununga</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Spl. 87, 8)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ealdor-dōm-scipe" d:title="ealdor-dōm-scipe">
		<body>
			<h1>ealdor-dōm-scipe<span class="pron"> | æ͜ɑl.dor.doːm.ʃi.pe |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Aldermanship</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hēr forðfērde Ælfhere ealdorman, and fēng Ælfrīc tō þām ilcan ealdordōmscipe (ealdormanscipe ?: ealdordōme, MS. E.)</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Chr. 983; P. 124, 35)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="folc-stōw" d:title="folc-stōw">
		<body>
			<h1>folc-stōw<span class="pron"> | folk.stoːw |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A public place, country place</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. publĭcus vel rustĭcus lŏcus)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">discurrĕre per urbāna et rustĭca lōca sŏlēbat</span>
							<span class="q-oe">He ferde ge þurh mynsterstōwe ge þurh folcstōwe</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Bd. 3, 5; S. 526, 27)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="āmolsnian" d:title="āmolsnian">
		<body>
			<h1>āmolsnian<span class="pron"> | ɑː.mol.sni.ɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">past: sg: -ode, sg: -ade</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">participle: past participle sg: -od, past participle sg: -ad</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">To corrupt, putrefy</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. putrefacere)</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:molsnian" class="xref-target">molsnian</a>
			</p>
