					<b>preposition</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-la">praecedebat eos Iesus</span>
						<span class="q-oe">Onfora wæs geongend hiā se Hǣlend</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Mk. L. 10, 32)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
