				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Undemanded</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">if a priest leave the yearly dues without payment asked</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Gif preōst geārgerihta unmynegode lǣte</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (L. N. P. L. 43; Th. ii. 296, 15)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:mynegian" class="xref-target">mynegian</a>
			</p>
