					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">swiftness, quickness</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ūs bær naca, snellīc sǣmearh, snūde bewunden (possessed by swiftness)</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Andr. Kmbl. 534; An. 267)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="or-dǣle" d:title="or-dǣle">
