			<h1>be-sprǣcen<span class="pron"> | be.spræː.Ken |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>participle</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">spoken to, charged</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:be-sprecan" class="xref-target">be-sprecan</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="for-grīwan" d:title="for-grīwan">
		<body>
			<h1>for-grīwan<span class="pron"> | for.griː.wɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">participle: past participle sg: -griwen</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">To sink in vice</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Þā þe on unrihttīdum on oferfylla biōð forgriwene</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Nap. 27, 30)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:be-grīwan" class="xref-target">be-grīwan</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="bȳrging" d:title="bȳrging">
		<body>
			<h1>bȳrging<span class="pron"> | byːr.Ging |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Taste, lasting</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. gustus)</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:on-bȳrging" class="xref-target">on-bȳrging</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="loca" d:title="loca">
		<body>
			<h1>loca<span class="pron"> | lo.kɑ |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
