			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -an</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A stake</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:temes-pīle" class="xref-target">temes-pīle</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ge-deftlice" d:title="ge-deftlice">
		<body>
			<h1>ge-deftlice<span class="pron"> | je.deft.li.Ke |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adverb</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Fitly, moderately</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. dēcenter)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">if thou wilt be healthy, drink in moderation</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Gif ðū wile hāl beōn, drinc ðē gedeftlice</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Prov. Kmbl. 61)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ge-dæftlīce" class="xref-target">ge-dæftlīce</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
