<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="āþindan" d:title="āþindan">
		<body>
			<h1>āþindan<span class="pron"> | ɑː.θin.dɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">past: sg: -þand, pl: -þundon</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">participle: past participle sg: -þunden</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">To puff up, swell, inflate</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. intumescere)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">tumida æquora placavit</span>
							<span class="q-oe">He ðā ðone aþundenan sǣ gesmylte</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Bd. 5, 1; S. 614, 8)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Gif he aþunden sȳ if he be swollen</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Herb. 1, 21 : Lchdm. i. 76, 27)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Aþindaþ occurs in Ps. Th. 106, 25 as a translation of tabescebat; the translator confounded tabescere with tumescere.</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Th. 106, 25)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:þindan" class="xref-target">þindan</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="frēfer-ness" d:title="frēfer-ness">
		<body>
			<h1>frēfer-ness<span class="pron"> | freː.fer.ness |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Consolation, comfort</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">habetis consolationem</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Giē habbað froefernise</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Lk. L. 6, 24)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="pyle" d:title="pyle">
		
		<body>
			<h1>pyle<span class="pron"> | py.le |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -s</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Pylu ceruical</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (An. Ox. 29, 4)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Pyles tācen is þæt þū mid þīnum scytefingre sume feþer tācnum gestrīce on þȳne wynstran hand innewearde and lecge tō þīnum eāron</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Tech. ii. 126, 6)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Bið se elnboga underlēd mid pyle</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Past. 143, 18)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Genim þās wyrte, lege him nytendum under his pyle</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Lch. i. 228, 1)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:heāfod-pyle" class="xref-target">heāfod-pyle</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="beren a barn" d:title="beren a barn">
