					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">of little value, for which little is paid</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ne weorðe ðē nǣfre tō þæs wā ðæt ðū ne wēne betran andergilde</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Prov. K. 41)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:un-andergilde" class="xref-target">un-andergilde</a>
			</p>
		</body>
