			<h1>mōdor-cynd<span class="pron"> | moː.dor.Kynd |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">The nature derived from the mother</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hē wæs sōþ man þurh his mēdrengecynd (mōdercynde, MS. H.)</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wulfst. 17. 7)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ge-cwed" d:title="ge-cwed">
