					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A declaration, an appointment</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. indictio)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Gecwed indictio</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 46, 18)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
