			<h1>borgas<span class="pron"> | bor.ɣɑs |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">sureties, debtors</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ge-sæltan" d:title="ge-sæltan">
		<body>
			<h1>ge-sæltan<span class="pron"> | je.sæl.tɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">participle: past participle sg: -sælted, past participle sg: -sælt</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">To salt</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ā-cuman" d:title="ā-cuman">
		<body>
			<h1>ā-cuman<span class="pron"> | ɑː.ku.mɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol class="labeled">
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">I.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">To come</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">he could not get outside the house</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Hē ne mihte būton ðām hrōfe ācuman</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. Th. ii. 184, 12)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">II.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">trans.</span>
					</p>
					<ol class="sub-senses labeled">
						<li>
							<p>
								<span class="sense-label">(1)</span>
								<span class="meaning-en">to bear, bring</span>
							</p>
							<ul class="quotes">
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Hī þurh deōfles lāre ðā menniscnesse tō deāðe ācōman</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Wlfst. 22, 23)</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>
								<span class="sense-label">(2)</span>
								<span class="meaning-en">to bear, support trouble, &amp;c.</span>
							</p>
							<ul class="quotes">
								<li>
									<span class="q-la">quis sustinebit</span>
									<span class="q-oe">Hwā ācymð</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Bl. Gl.)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-la">certavi (bonum certamen)</span>
									<span class="q-oe">Ic ācom</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (An. Ox. 1349)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Strang gyld, ðæt man hit uneāðe ācom (mihte ācuman, v. l.)</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Chr. 1040; P. 160, 30)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Heō ēhtnysse ācom</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. S. 7, 3)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Hē ǣlc þing dō and ācume</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (R. Ben. 113, 10)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Hē wītu ācōme</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. S. 23, 119)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Ðæt hī ðone cyle ācōman</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (11, 221)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Ācuman (impetum) ferre, perferre</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Kent. Gl. 1014: An. Ox. 7, 314)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Ācuman costnunge, ceāste, mōdleāste, graman</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. Th. i. 4, 8: Hml. S. 7, 243: 9, 125: Hml. A. 100, 266)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Ūre ceaster is þearfende and ne mæg ðīne æðelborennesse ācuman</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Ap. Th. 9, 8)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-la">ut auditoris sui animum ultra vires non trahat</span>
									<span class="q-oe">Ðæt hē nānum men māre ne beōde ðonne hē ācuman mæge</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Past. 459, 7)</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="q-oe">Ne mæg ic āna ācuman (sustinere) eall ðis folc</span>
									<span class="q-cite"> (Num. 11, 14)</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</li>
					</ol>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="bȳed" d:title="bȳed">
		<body>
			<h1>bȳed<span class="pron"> | byː.ed |</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:un-bȳed" class="xref-target">un-bȳed</a>
