		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="lang-līce" d:title="lang-līce">
		
		<body>
			<h1>lang-līce<span class="pron"> | lɑng.liː.tʃe |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adverb</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Langlīce þrowian</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. Th. i. 594, 31)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Langlīce tǣcan</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. S. 36, 244)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ān-līce" d:title="ān-līce">
		<body>
			<h1>ān-līce<span class="pron"> | ɑːn.liː.tʃe |</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ǣn-līce" class="xref-target">ǣn-līce</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ge-swicn" d:title="ge-swicn">
		<body>
			<h1>ge-swicn<span class="pron"> | je.swikn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A cleansing, clearance</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. purgātio)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">he shall not have the clearance</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Nāh he ða geswicne</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (L. In. 15; Th. i. 112, 5, MSS. B. H.)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="Biedan heāfod" d:title="Biedan heāfod">
		<body>
			<h1>Biedan heāfod<span class="pron"> | bi͜y.dɑn, xæ͜ɑː.fod |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -heāfdes, dative sg: -heāfde</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">BIEDA'S HEAD = Bedwin, Wilts?</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">Wulfhere and Æscwine fought at Bedwin</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Hēr Wulfhere and Æscwine gefuhton æt Biedan heāfde here, A. D. 675</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Chr. 675; Erl. 36, 9; Th. 58, 15, col. 1, 3)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="sige-mēce" d:title="sige-mēce">
