						<span class="q-cite"> (Wlfst. 82, 6)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="brōþor-sunu" d:title="brōþor-sunu">
		<body>
			<h1>brōþor-sunu<span class="pron"> | broː.θor.su.nu |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -a</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A nephew</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">frat[r]uelis</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Brōðorsunu</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 109, 17)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">nepos</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Brōðersune</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (i. 51, 71)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Cynegils, Ceōlwulfes brōþursunu</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Chr. P. 2, 14)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Brōþursunu (brōðor-, v.l.)</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (887 ; P. 80, 17)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Griffines brōðersunu</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (1097; P. 233, 22)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">cum fratrueli</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Mid brōðorsuna</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 87, 12: 19, 13: 34, 57)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="sunna" d:title="sunna">
