							<span class="q-oe">Weorpan hī an wildedeōra līc</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Bt. 38, I; Fox 194, 31)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">erat cum bestiis</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Hē wæs mid wildedeōrum</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Mk. Skt. Lind. Rush. 1, 13)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
