				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A beast of burden, a mule</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. burdus)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hors equus, hengest caballus, seāmere burdus ( = burdo; hic burdo, i. genitum inter equum et asinam, 219, col. l)</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. i. 287, 42-44)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Seāmere burdus, oxa bova</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (ii. 11, 61-62)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
