					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">a shower of iron missiles</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">þone þe oft gebād īsernscere</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (B. 3116)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
