				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">having an indented outline, serrated</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. serrata)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">serrata</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Gewrinclode serrata</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Germ. 398, 217)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="laur-beām" d:title="laur-beām">
		<body>
			<h1>laur-beām<span class="pron"> | lɑ.ur.bæ͜ɑːm |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Laurel</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. Laurbeām daphnis vel laurus)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Laurbeām daphnis vel laurus</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ælfc. Gl. 45; Som. 64, 110; Wrt. Voc. 32, 45)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Lauwer [lawer] beām laurus</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. 79, 78)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Laurbeāme gelīce similes lauro</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Nar. 36, 30)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ge-sweordod" d:title="ge-sweordod">
		<body>
			<h1>ge-sweordod<span class="pron"> | je.swe͜or.dod |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Provided with a sword</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. gladiatus)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">gladiatus</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Gesweordod (-swurd-, -swyrd-, v. ll. ) gladiatus</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ælfc. Gr. Z. 257, 1)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">þā cwōmon twēgen englas gescildode and gesweordode</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Nap. 32)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="eāðelic" d:title="eāðelic">
		
		<body>
			<h1>eāðelic<span class="pron"> | æ͜ɑː.θe.liK |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Easy, possible</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. fācilis)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">with God all things are possible</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ealle þing synt mid Gode eāðelīce</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Mt. Bos. 19, 26)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">what is easier?</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Hwæt is eāðelīcre</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (9, 5)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:un-eāðelīc" class="xref-target">un-eāðelīc</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:ǣðe-līc" class="xref-target">ǣðe-līc</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="heāfod-cwide" d:title="heāfod-cwide">
		<body>
			<h1>heāfod-cwide<span class="pron"> | xæ͜ɑː.fod.kwi.de |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol class="labeled">
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">I.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">a saying of especial importance</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. quattuor dicta præcipua in Actibus Apostolorum sic præcipiunt)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">quattuor dicta præcipua in Actibus Apostolorum sic præcipiunt</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ða iiii heāfodcwidas in Actibus Apostolorum ðus bebeōdaþ</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (L. Ecg. C. 38; Th. ii. 162, 33)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">II.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">a chapter</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. incipiunt capitulæ)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">incipiunt capitulæ</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Onginnaþ heāfudcuido</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Rtl. 166, 17)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="feorh-þearf" d:title="feorh-þearf">
		<body>
			<h1>feorh-þearf<span class="pron"> | fe͜orx.θæ͜ɑrf |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Distress of life, urgent need</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. vītæ necessĭtas)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">Domine ad adjuvandum me festīna</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Drihten me hraðe gefultuma æt feorhþearfe</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Th. 69, 1)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="hed-clāþ" d:title="hed-clāþ">
