						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. cursim)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ryn(elīce?) cursim</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (An. Ox. 7. 90)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="breāt" d:title="breāt">
		<body>
			<h1>breāt<span class="pron"> | bræ͜ɑːt |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>participle</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">destroyed; p. of breōtan</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">breāt</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Beo. Th. 3430; B. 1713)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="incge" d:title="incge">
		<body>
			<h1>incge<span class="pron"> | indʒ.dʒe |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">in the phrase incge lāfe [a sword]</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">a sword</span>
							<span class="q-oe">incge lāfe</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Beo. Th. 5747; 13. 2577)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="bēcnan" d:title="bēcnan">
		<body>
			<h1>bēcnan<span class="pron"> | beː.knɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">past: sg: -ede</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">participle: past participle sg: -ed</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">To indicate, denote, signify</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. indicare, significare)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">which we will denote by the bridle</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ðe we mid ðæm bridle bēcnan tiliaþ</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Bt. Met. Fox 11, 158; Met. 11, 79 : Exon. 110 a; Th. 421, 31; Rä. 40, 26 : 106 b ; Th. 407, 5 ; Rä. 25, 10)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:beācnian" class="xref-target">beācnian</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="tō-leoðian" d:title="tō-leoðian">
