<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="word-fæst" d:title="word-fæst">
		<body>
			<h1>word-fæst<span class="pron"> | word.fæst |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Adhering to what one says, keeping one's word</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Se hlāford sceal beōn egesfull ðam dysegum, ðæt hē heora dysig ālecge ; and hē sceal beōn wordfæst and witan hwæt hē clypige (he seal beon weordfeste and wise lare lusten, III, 32)</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (O. E. Homl. i. 301, 13)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:word-loga" class="xref-target">word-loga</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ge-siehþ" d:title="ge-siehþ">
		<body>
			<h1>ge-siehþ<span class="pron"> | je.si͜yxθ |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
