			<h1>Eatol-ware<span class="pron"> | æ͜ɑ.tol.wɑ.re |</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:Eotol-ware" class="xref-target">Eotol-ware</a>
