			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:and-lōman" class="xref-target">and-lōman</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:andge-lōman" class="xref-target">andge-lōman</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:ge-lōman" class="xref-target">ge-lōman</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="fræfele" d:title="fræfele">
