			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="pīnness" d:title="pīnness">
		<body>
			<h1>pīnness<span class="pron"> | piːn.ness |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Torment, pain</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Tō ðare helware stīðe pīnnesse</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Chart. Th. 369. 34)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="an-leofa" d:title="an-leofa">
		<body>
			<h1>an-leofa<span class="pron"> | ɑn.le͜o.fɑ |</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:and-leofa" class="xref-target">and-leofa</a>
			</p>
		</body>
