			<h1>Rōm-wealh<span class="pron"> | roːm.wæ͜ɑlx |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -weales</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
