					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A Roman</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">jus Quiritum</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Reht Rōmwala</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Rtl. 189, 13)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ic wæs mid Rūmwalum</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Exon. Th. 322, 27; Vīd. 69)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:wealh" class="xref-target">wealh</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
