			<h1>HEĀÐU-SIGEL<span class="pron"> | xæ͜ɑː.θu.si.Gel |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">The battle-sun</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="grund-sopa" d:title="grund-sopa">
		<body>
			<h1>grund-sopa<span class="pron"> | grund.so.pɑ |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -an</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">The word translates cartilago in the following glosses</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Grundsopa (-suopa) cartilago</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Txts. 49, 402: Wrt. Voc. ii. 13, 50)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Cartilago grundsopa, coriza, sternutatio fnora</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (128, 79, 80)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">coriza, i. sternutatio, cartilagines nebgebraec vel fnora</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 135, 77)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Cortex bark; liber, interior pars corticis; suber, intima pars corticis; abdomen grundsope</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. i. 229, 24-27)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:nebgebraec" class="xref-target">nebgebraec</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="SUM" d:title="SUM">
		<body>
			<h1>SUM<span class="pron"> | sum |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>pronoun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol class="labeled">
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">I.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">Some one, a certain one, used as a pronoun</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">One said, another said</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Sum cwæð, sum cwæð</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol class="labeled">
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">II.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">Some, a certain, used as an adjective</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ōþ" d:title="ōþ">
		<body>
			<h1>ōþ<span class="pron"> | oːθ |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>conjunction</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Hē wæs winnende, oð him se mǣsta dǣl wearð underþiēded</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Ors. 1, 10; S. 44, 5)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Hē wunode mid hire oð hana sang</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Shrn. 30, 29)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Sēc hyne oð þū hyne finde</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Solil. H. 3, 15: 59, 9)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Ic þat wilnode oð mē nū āðreāð</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (35, 22)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:oþ" class="xref-target">oþ</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="fylgend-ness" d:title="fylgend-ness">
