						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Wīdnyt (wīd nyt?) funda</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. i. 22, 21)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="hearm-heortness" d:title="hearm-heortness">
