			<h1>filican<span class="pron"> | fi.li.kɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">On filican slǣd.</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Cht. E. 389, 7)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:fīlian" class="xref-target">fīlian</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="wan-hygd" d:title="wan-hygd">
		
		<body>
			<h1>wan-hygd<span class="pron"> | wɑn.xyɣd |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">want of mind, folly, rashness, recklessness, imprudence</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">For wlence and for wonhygdum hī ceastre worhton, and tō heofnum up hlǣdræ rǣrdon,</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Cd. Th. 100, 33; Gen. 1673)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Grendel for his wonhȳdum wǣpna ne rēcceþ ; ic ðæt ðonne forhicge ðæt ic sweord bere,</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Beo. Th. 872; B. 434)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="un-lygen" d:title="un-lygen">
		<body>
			<h1>un-lygen<span class="pron"> | un.ly.Gen |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Unlying, truthful</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ceāpige man on ðæs portgerēfan gewitnesse oþþe ōðres unlygenes mannes</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (L. Ath. i. 12; Th. i. 206, 10)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:un-gelygen" class="xref-target">un-gelygen</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="un-gewuna" d:title="un-gewuna">
		<body>
			<h1>un-gewuna<span class="pron"> | un.Ge.wu.nɑ |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Unaccustomed, unused</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Micel gedāl is on ðam mægene ðæs ðe siē gewin (-wun?) þrowungum and ðæs ðe siē ungewuna swelcum þingum</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Lchdm. ii. 84, 19)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="stōc" d:title="stōc">
		
		<body>
			<h1>stōc<span class="pron"> | stoːk |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-la">ingentis saxi moles erupta est, quae . . . veniens totius ruinam cellae, omniumque fratrum interitum minabatur</span>
						<span class="q-oe">Ꝥ āborstene clif hreās ofdūneweard . . . and wæs farende oþ ꝥ hit cōm þǣr hit mynte feallan ofer ꝥ mynster, and ꝥ þonne wǣre hryre ealles þæs stoces (stōwes. v. l.) and forwyrd ealra þǣra brōðra</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Gr. D. 12, 12)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-la">in Cassinum castrum</span>
						<span class="q-oe">In Cassinum þǣre stōwe (ꝥ stoc, þām stocwīc, v. ll.)</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (172, 5)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">I faderr stoke</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Orm. 9778)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Þe&amp;yogh;&amp;yogh; liccness off Cherubyn o twe&amp;yogh;&amp;yogh;enn stokess metedd</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (1049)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="emb-wlātian" d:title="emb-wlātian">
		<body>
			<h1>emb-wlātian<span class="pron"> | emb.wlɑː.ti.ɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">present: 1sg: -wlātige</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">past: sg: -ode</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">participle: past participle sg: -od</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">To look about, contemplate</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. contemplāri)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ic embwlātige contemplor</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ælfc. Gr. 25; Som. 27, 5, MS. D.)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ymb-wlātian" class="xref-target">ymb-wlātian</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="sīc" d:title="sīc">
