					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Drihtnes encgel hyre gecīgde þone hāmsīþ hyre gemæccan</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. A. 125, 273)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="mǣr-þorn" d:title="mǣr-þorn">
