				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Feltwurma origanum</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 65, 45)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="asc-þrotu" d:title="asc-þrotu">
