			<h1>un-āberiende<span class="pron"> | un.ɑː.be.ri͜yn.de |</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:un-āberendlīc" class="xref-target">un-āberendlīc</a>
