							<span class="q-oe">Sume synna beōþ swīþe unsȳferlīce, ðæt se man wandaþ ðæt hē hī ǣfre āsecgge</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Blickl. Homl. 43, 17)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
