						<span class="meaning-en">Babylon</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. Babŷlŏn, ōnis; f)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">super flumina Babilonis</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ofer flōd Babilōniscan</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Lamb. 136, 1)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:Babilōnisc" class="xref-target">Babilōnisc</a>
			</p>
