					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">past: sg: -de</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">To hinder, prohibit</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">eos qui introiebant prohibuistis</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ðā ðā ðe infoerdon forestemdon (for-, R.) giē</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Lk. L. 11, 52)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="āc-hal" d:title="āc-hal">
