			<h1>nīd-þearf<span class="pron"> | niːd.θæ͜ɑrf |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-la">plerumque piger necessaria agere negligit</span>
						<span class="q-oe">Oft sē slāwa āgǣlð ðæt weorc ðe him niēdðearf wǣre tō wyrceanne</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Past. 283, 25)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
