			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A crowd, troop, band of people</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">to press in crowds</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Hwearfum þringan</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Judth. 12; Thw. 25, 8; Jud. 249)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:hweorfan" class="xref-target">hweorfan</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:gang" class="xref-target">gang</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="niht-buttorfleōge" d:title="niht-buttorfleōge">
		<body>
			<h1>niht-buttorfleōge<span class="pron"> | nixt.but.tor.fle͜oː.Ge |</span>
