					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Exorable</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. deprecābilis)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">deprecābilis esto super servos tuos</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Wes ðīnum scealcum wel eāðbēde</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Th. 89, 15)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="hūsel-portic" d:title="hūsel-portic">
