				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Sacristy</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">sepultus est corpore ante secretarium</span>
							<span class="q-oe">His līchoma wæs bebyriged beforan ðam hūselportice</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Bd. 2, 1; S. 500, 15)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="hādung-dæg" d:title="hādung-dæg">
		<body>
			<h1>hādung-dæg<span class="pron"> | xɑː.dung.dæj |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">The anniversary of a person's ordination</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Þā gelamp hit embe geāres ryne ꝥ hit wæs þæs abbodes hādingdæg. Þā sende ānne brððor tō Pafnuntie and laþode hine tō þǣre symbelnesse</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. S. 33, 59)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hādungdæg</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (91)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="sīn" d:title="sīn">
		<body>
			<h1>sīn<span class="pron"> | siːn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">a sight, spectacle</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:wæfer-sīn" class="xref-target">wæfer-sīn</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:wlite-sīn" class="xref-target">wlite-sīn</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:wundor-sīn" class="xref-target">wundor-sīn</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:ymb-sīn" class="xref-target">ymb-sīn</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ge-mǣrsung" d:title="ge-mǣrsung">
		
		<body>
			<h1>ge-mǣrsung<span class="pron"> | je.mæːr.sung |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Magnificence</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. magnificentia)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">ut nōtam făciant glōriam magnĭfĭcentiæ regni tui</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ðæt hī cūðe wyrcan wuldor gemǣrsunge rīces ðīnes</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Spl. 144, 12)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Gimērsung celebritas</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Rtl. 48, 20)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="æ-wnian" d:title="æ-wnian">
