			<h1>æ-wnian<span class="pron"> | æ.wni.ɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ge-æ-wnod" class="xref-target">ge-æ-wnod</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="eorþ-weard" d:title="eorþ-weard">
		<body>
			<h1>eorþ-weard<span class="pron"> | e͜orθ.wæ͜ɑrd |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">What guards a land, a fortress</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="gast-hūs" d:title="gast-hūs">
		<body>
			<h1>gast-hūs<span class="pron"> | gɑst.xuːs |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>neuter noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A guest-house, guest-chamber</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. hospitium)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">nequitia est in hospitiis eorum</span>
							<span class="q-oe">On heora gast-hūsum is gramlīc inwit</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Th. 54, 15)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:gæst-hūs" class="xref-target">gæst-hūs</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="horn-sæl" d:title="horn-sæl">
		<body>
			<h1>horn-sæl<span class="pron"> | xorn.sæl |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>neuter noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A hall having 'horns' in its roof</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hornsalu</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Andr. Kmbl. 2318; An. 1160)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:horn-reced" class="xref-target">horn-reced</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:horn-sele" class="xref-target">horn-sele</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="-lǣce" d:title="-lǣce">
