				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">An iron byrnie or corslet</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hē him of dyde īsernbyrnan</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Beo. Th. 1347 ; B. 671)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:īren-byrne" class="xref-target">īren-byrne</a>
			</p>
