						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. originaliter)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Frymfþlīce originaliter</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (An. Ox. 5211)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
