			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="wisse(?)" d:title="wisse(?)">
		<body>
			<h1>wisse(?)<span class="pron"> | wis.se |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adverb</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Certainly</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Sculan wē wrecan wordum forð, wisse gesingan, ðæt . . .</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Menol. Fox 140; Men. 70)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ge-wisse" class="xref-target">ge-wisse</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
