						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. ignītus)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">est ignītum elōquium tuum vehementer</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Is fȳrenfull spæc ðīn swīðlīce</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Lamb. 118, 140)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
