							<span class="q-la">cum carbonibus desolatoriis</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Mid glēdum tōlȳsendlīcum</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Lamb. 119, 4)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
