<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="handlung" d:title="handlung">
		<body>
			<h1>handlung<span class="pron"> | xɑnd.lung |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Touching, handling</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">whom the blessed Benedict not by touching him, but by looking on him, had released from his bonds</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ðone ðe se eādiga Benedictus nā handlunge ac on beseōnde fram his bendum ālȳsde</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Homl. Th. ii. 182, 4)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
