						<span class="meaning-en">to you, YOU</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. vōbis, vos)</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:gē" class="xref-target">gē</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="-lǣðu" d:title="-lǣðu">
