			<h1>ge-eæd-leǣnian<span class="pron"> | je.e.æd.le.æː.ni.ɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">present: 1sg: -ic -eædleǣnige</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">to repay, reward</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ed-leǣnian" class="xref-target">ed-leǣnian</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="for-boda" d:title="for-boda">
