					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Of a sheep</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Sceāpen smera (cf. on sceāpes smerwe, 1. 9)</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Lchdm. ii. 128, 16)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ete sceāpen flǣsc and nān ōþer</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (358, 22)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="scearpþanc-līce" d:title="scearpþanc-līce">
		
		<body>
			<h1>scearpþanc-līce<span class="pron"> | ʃæ͜ɑrp.θɑnk.liː.tʃe |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adverb</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-la">tunc praedicatio utiliter profertur, quando efficaciter adimpletur</span>
						<span class="q-oe">Þænne bodung nytlīce byð forðgerǣht þænne scearpþanclīce byð gefylled</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Scint. 125, 7)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="gylting" d:title="gylting">
