						<span class="meaning-en">Back</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">convertentur inimici mei retrorsum</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Onhinderling hweorfaþ mīne feōndas</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Th. 55, 8: 69, 3)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:on-bæcling" class="xref-target">on-bæcling</a>
			</p>
