				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Ymb þā foreward þe wǣron geworhte ... And sē ðe þās foreward tōbreke</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (C.D. iv. 263, 13-21)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="āgetan" d:title="āgetan">
