						<span class="q-cite"> (Wlfst. 263, 6)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="weall" d:title="weall">
		<body>
			<h1>weall<span class="pron"> | wæ͜ɑll |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>neuter noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Boiled or mulled wine</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Defrutum, i. vinum medo geswēt vel weall</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 138, 24)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Nīwes ł ge―sodenes wealles defruti ł medoni</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Hpt. Gl. 414, 1)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Wealle defruto, vino</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (520, 38)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="wræc" d:title="wræc">
		<body>
			<h1>wræc<span class="pron"> | wræK |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
