					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">III.</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Adam wæs ādrifen of neorcxnawanges gefeān . . . and becōm in þā yrmðe þises wræces (exilii)</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Gr. D. 260, 7-18)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="gēn-dele" d:title="gēn-dele">
		
