						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:of-dæl" class="xref-target">of-dæl</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:-dæle" class="xref-target">-dæle</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:geān-dȳne" class="xref-target">geān-dȳne</a>
			</p>
