						<span class="meaning-en">Liberally</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Cystiglīcor largius</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Hy. S. 29, 21)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:cyste-līce" class="xref-target">cyste-līce</a>
			</p>
