			<h1>gifre<span class="pron"> | Gi.fre |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-en">the subject of the riddle is a bookcase, the gifre lāc are books</span>
						<span class="q-oe">Ic wāt eardfæstne ānne standan, deāfne dumban, sē oft swilged gifrum lāicum</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Rä. 50, 3. 7u In Rä 270 a book is the subject.)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
