						<span class="meaning-en">Gluttony</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. gula)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">refrenant gulam</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Gemidliaþ hiera giefernesse [gīfernesse, MS. Cot.] refrenant gulam</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Past. 46, 2; Swt. 345, 23; Hat. MS. 66 a, 9)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:gīfernes" class="xref-target">gīfernes</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="hrā-līc" d:title="hrā-līc">
