					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Deadly [?], funereal [?]</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. funebris)</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
