				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">to inebriate</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hī wǣron ondrencte mid oferdrynce</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Guthl. 14; Gdwin. 62, 20)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:in-drencan" class="xref-target">in-drencan</a>
			</p>
