				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -an</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Fiveleaf, cinquefoil; potemilla reptans, quinquefŏlium</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="stēpan to bereave" d:title="stēpan to bereave">
