			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">see, look, behold</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. aspice)</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:be-seōn" class="xref-target">be-seōn</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="in-gefeoht" d:title="in-gefeoht">
		<body>
			<h1>in-gefeoht<span class="pron"> | in.Ge.fe͜oxt |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>neuter noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Intestine or civil war</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">ut Brittones quiescentibus ad tempus exteris, civilibus sese bellis contriverint</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ðætte Bryttas sume tīd gestildon fram ūtgefeohte and hie sylfe þræston on ingefeohtum</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Bd. 1, 22; S. 485, 12)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:in-gewinn" class="xref-target">in-gewinn</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="hwistlung" d:title="hwistlung">
		<body>
			<h1>hwistlung<span class="pron"> | xwist.lung |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol class="labeled">
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">I.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">hissing, whistling</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Leōhtlic hwyslung (sibilus) mæg hors tamcyan</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Chrd. 96, 18)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">sibilabat tota regio</span>
							<span class="q-oe">lond hleōðrade for þāra wyrma [hw]istlunge</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Nar. 13, 22)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Mislice fugela hwistlunge</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Guth. 48, 5)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">sibilos serpentium</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Nædddrena hwistlunge</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Gr. D. 185, 3)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">II.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">piping, playing on a pipe</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="geswincfulnys" d:title="geswincfulnys">
		<body>
			<h1>geswincfulnys<span class="pron"> | Ge.swink.ful.nys |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Sorrow, affliction, tribulation</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. tribulatio)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">de omnibus tribulationibus ejus salvabit eum</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Of eallum geswincfulnyssum he gehǣlde hine</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Lamb. 33, 7)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="-sibness" d:title="-sibness">
