<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="scinu" d:title="scinu">
		<body>
			<h1>scinu<span class="pron"> | ʃi.nu |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A shin</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Scinu cruscula</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 137, 20)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Scina vel scinbān tibiae</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (i. 44, 72)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Scyne oððe scinbān tibia (ae?)</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (71, 58)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Scina</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (65, 42)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Scancan, scina tibias</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Hpt. Gl. 482, 64)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:scin-bān" class="xref-target">scin-bān</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="scill" d:title="scill">
		
		<body>
			<h1>scill<span class="pron"> | ʃill |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol class="labeled">
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">I.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">a shell, shell-fish</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">conca</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Musclan scil conca</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 15, 35)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Scel.</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (105, 37)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Scel echinus, i. piscis, cancer</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (142, 24: 106, 75)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">de concha</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Musclan ł scille de concha</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Hpt. Gl. 417, 10)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">conchae vel cochleae</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Scille vel sǣsnæglas conchae vel cochleae</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. i. 56, 7)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Scellum concis</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (ii. 15, 18)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">II.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">the shell of an egg</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Se rodor ymbfēhþ ūtan eall þās niðerlīcan gescæfte, swā seō scell ymbfēhþ ðæt ǣg</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Shrn. 63, 10: Met. 20, 174)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Fæger swylce hē of ǣgerum ūt ālǣde, scīr of scylle</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Exon. Th. 214, 4; Ph. 234)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">III.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">a scale of a fish, serpent, etc.</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">sub squamarum specie de ejus satellitibus perhibetur: Una uni conjungitur</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Hiō dyde sciella tō bisene his heor neohtum and ðus cwæð: Ǣlces fisces sciell biþ tō oðerre gefēged</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Past. 47, 3; Swt. 361, 17)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Sumum (serpents) scinan ða scilla swylce hiē wǣron gyldene.</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Nar. 13, 19)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ðonne hiē (the serpent) mon slōg oððe sceāt, ðonne glād hit on ðǣm scyllum, swelce hit wǣre smēðe īsen.</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ors. 4, 6; Swt. 174, 8)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">crura tegunt squamae</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Sindon ða scancan scyllum biweaxen</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Exon. Th. 219, 21; Ph. 310)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Ne ete gē nānne fisc būton ða ðe habbaþ finnas and scilla</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Lev. 11, 9)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="sense-label">IV.</span>
						<span class="meaning-en">a shell-shaped dish (?) or simply a shell</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Nim leōn gelynde, mylt on scylle (a dish or a shell?)</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Lchdm. i. 364, 24)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Wyrme on scille</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (ii. 42, 16: 310, 6)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ǣg-scill" class="xref-target">ǣg-scill</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:oster-scill" class="xref-target">oster-scill</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:sǣ-scill" class="xref-target">sǣ-scill</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:weolc-scill" class="xref-target">weolc-scill</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="æt-swerian" d:title="æt-swerian">
		
		<body>
			<h1>æt-swerian<span class="pron"> | æt.swe.ri.ɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:oþ-swerian" class="xref-target">oþ-swerian</a>
