		<body>
			<h1>ge-sealdniss<span class="pron"> | je.sæ͜ɑld.niss |</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ge-saldniss" class="xref-target">ge-saldniss</a>
