			<h1>stān-weg<span class="pron"> | stɑːn.wej |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A road made with stones</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">On ealdan stānwege; of stānwege</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Cod. Dip. B. i. 417, 15)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:stān-strǣt" class="xref-target">stān-strǣt</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="dolh-ben" d:title="dolh-ben">
		
