			<h1>hleahtor-lic<span class="pron"> | xlæ͜ɑx.tor.liːtʃ |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-la">ridiculum est debilitate fracta totius corporis uulnera pauca monstrare</span>
						<span class="q-oe">Hlehterlic hit ys wanhālnysse tōbrocenre ealles līchaman wunda feāwa geswutelian</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Scint. 38, 7)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:leahtor-lic" class="xref-target">leahtor-lic</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="heāh-flōd" d:title="heāh-flōd">
		<body>
			<h1>heāh-flōd<span class="pron"> | xæ͜ɑːx.floːd |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">High tide [as opposed to neap tide], deep water</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Heāhflōd malina: nēpflōd ledona</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ælfc. Gl. 105; Som. 78, 30, 29; Wrt. Voc. 37, 12, 11)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">he let a raven fly over the deep water [of the deluge]</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Lēt fleōgan hrefn ofer heāhflōd</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Cd. 71; Th. 87, 1; Gen. 1442)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ON-ĒGAN" d:title="ON-ĒGAN">
