			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ge-tælsum" class="xref-target">ge-tælsum</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ge-þegnian" d:title="ge-þegnian">
		<body>
			<h1>ge-þegnian<span class="pron"> | je.θe.ɣni.ɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Is āwriten ðætte Dauid suīðlīce hreōwsade ðæt hē him (Saul) suā ungeriesenlīce geðēnigan (-ðēnian, v. l.) sceolde</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Past. 199, 18)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="fōr-stondan" d:title="fōr-stondan">
		<body>
			<h1>fōr-stondan<span class="pron"> | foːr.ston.dɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">to stand before or against, oppose, hinder</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:fōr-standan" class="xref-target">fōr-standan</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ācen" d:title="ācen">
