					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Knowledge, conception</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">a luce se supernae cognitionis excludit</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Hē hiene bedǣlþ ðære oncnāwnesse ðæs uplecan leōhtes</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Past. 11, 4; Swt. 69, 24)</span>
						</li>
