							<span class="q-la">pro gualilate criminis</span>
							<span class="q-oe">For gehwilcnysse leahtres</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Hy. S. 36, 28)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">secundum locorum qualitatem</span>
