							<span class="q-cite"> (R. Ben. I. 91, 10)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Būtan þissum þingum . . . synt geswutelunga and gehwylcnyssa</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Angl. viii. 299, 23)</span>
						</li>
