						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Andlanges furh on brēmelþornan on ða ealdan dīc</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (C. D. iii. 10, 22)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="dǣl-nimend" d:title="dǣl-nimend">
		<body>
			<h1>dǣl-nimend<span class="pron"> | dæːl.ni.mend |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Daelniomend particeps</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Srt. 118, 63)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Dǣlnimendras consortes, i. participes</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (An. Ox. 1902)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="comēta" d:title="comēta">
		<body>
			<h1>comēta<span class="pron"> | ko.meː.tɑ |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -an</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A comet</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. comēta, comētes, æ; m. = GREEK , ov; m. long-haired)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">the wise-minded call a comet by name</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Higegleāwe hātaþ comēta be naman</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Chr. 975; Th. 228, 38, col. 1, 2, 3; Edg. 52)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="bi-þearf" d:title="bi-þearf">
