				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">I need</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">I need</span>
							<span class="q-oe">bi-þearf ic</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Exon. 76 a; Th. 285, 17; Jul. 715)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:bi-þurfan" class="xref-target">bi-þurfan</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:be-" class="xref-target">be-</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="swornian" d:title="swornian">
		
		<body>
			<h1>swornian<span class="pron"> | swor.ni.ɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">past: sg: -ode</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">To coalesce</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">coaluissent</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Suornodun, suornadun, suarnadun</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Txts. 48, 198)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Swornodon</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Wrt. Voc. ii. 14, 64)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ā-swarnian" class="xref-target">ā-swarnian</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="syrf-treōw" d:title="syrf-treōw">
		<body>
			<h1>syrf-treōw<span class="pron"> | syrf.tre͜oːw |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>neuter noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
