						<span class="meaning-en">A service-tree</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. sorbus)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">In ðæt syrftreōw; of ðam syrftreōw in ðæt rūge mapel-treōw</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Cod. Dip. Kmbl. iii. 379, 22)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ge-welhwilc" d:title="ge-welhwilc">
