							<span class="q-la">concēpit dolōrem et pēperit inīquitatem</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Gecende sārnessa and gehrifede oððe acende unrihtwīsnesse</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Lamb. 7, 15)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
