<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="hū-līc" d:title="hū-līc">
		<body>
			<h1>hū-līc<span class="pron"> | xuː.liːtʃ |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>pronoun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Of what sort</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. qualis)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">he asked what king Alexander was doing, and what sort of man he was, and of what age</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Hē āhsode hwæt alexander se cyning dyde and hūlīc mon hē wǣre and in hwylcere yldo</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Nar. 18, 12)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">I will tell you what it [Carthage] was like</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Nū ic wille secgan hūlucu heō wæs</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ors. 4, 13; Bos. 99, 57)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">qualis est hic?</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Hūlīc is ðes</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Mt. Kmbl. Rush. 8, 27)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hūlīc is se organ tō begonganne</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Salm. Kmbl. 107; Sal. 53)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Hūlig</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Lk. Skt. Lind. 1, 29)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">aspice quales lapides et quales structuræ</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Gisih hūlīce [hūlco, Lind.] stānas and hūlīc [huulig, Lind.] timber</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Mk. Skt. Rush. 13, 1)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:hwilc" class="xref-target">hwilc</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="smeaþancol-līce" d:title="smeaþancol-līce">
		
		<body>
			<h1>smeaþancol-līce<span class="pron"> | smæ͜ɑ.θɑn.kol.liː.tʃe |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adverb</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-la">loca singula subtiliter designavit</span>
						<span class="q-oe">Hē him swȳðe smeāþancollīce getǣhte þā syndrigan stōwa</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Gr. D. 148, 15)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-la">requirens subtiliter agnovit</span>
						<span class="q-oe">Hē smeāþancollīce āxiende oncneōw</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (172, 14)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Hī embe þæt heofonlice līf geornlīce smeādon swȳðe smeāþancollīce</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. S. 3, 509)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ge-recce-līc" d:title="ge-recce-līc">
		<body>
			<h1>ge-recce-līc<span class="pron"> | je.rek.Ke.liːtʃ |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>adjective</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">Stretched out, extended, strict, firm, steadfast</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. extensus, strictus, firmus)</span>
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="pyll" d:title="pyll">
		<body>
			<h1>pyll<span class="pron"> | pyll |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A pool, pill ('Pill, a small creek, Hereford. The channels through which the drainings of the marshes enter the river are termed pills,' Halliwell. Pill, a pool, a creek, E. D. S. Publ. Cornish Gloss. See also Seebohm's English Village Community, pp. 149-150)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Andlang dice west on pull; of pylle on ford ... eft on gerihte innan mycela pyll ; of mycela pylle on smala pyll ; andlang pylles . . . on ða dīc innan holapyll; andlang holapylles</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Cod. Dip. Kmbl. iii. 449, 11-22)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:pōl" class="xref-target">pōl</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:pull" class="xref-target">pull</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="cwidian" d:title="cwidian">
		<body>
			<h1>cwidian<span class="pron"> | kwi.di.ɑn |</span>
