			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:gilm" class="xref-target">gilm</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="fōre-steall" d:title="fōre-steall">
		<body>
			<h1>fōre-steall<span class="pron"> | foː.re.stæ͜ɑll |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A leaping before, forestalling, rescue</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. assultus, interceptio)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">the Jewish elders earnestly deliberated how they might slay Jesus Christ, but they dreaded a rescue by the people</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ða Iudēiscan ealdras geornlīce smeādon hū hī Hǣlend Crist acwellan mihton, ondrēdon him swā-ðeāh ðæs folces fōresteall</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Homl. Th. ii. 242, 14)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:fōr-steal" class="xref-target">fōr-steal</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="hell-deōful" d:title="hell-deōful">
