	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="forscapung" d:title="forscapung">
		<body>
			<h1>forscapung<span class="pron"> | for.ʃɑ.pung |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">hǣte nǣre for hiora synnum, ac sǣdon ꝥ hiō wǣre for Fetontis forscapunge</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Ors. 1, 7; S. 40, 9)</span>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="q-la">diuturnitatem illius obsidionis, eversionis atrocitatem, caedem, captivitatemque</span>
						<span class="q-oe">Ungetīma and tibernessa ǣgðer ge on monslihtum ge on hungre ge on scipgebroce ge on mislicre forscapunge</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (1, 11; S. 50, 20)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:scippan" class="xref-target">scippan</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="bed-clȳfa" d:title="bed-clȳfa">
		
		
		<body>
			<h1>bed-clȳfa<span class="pron"> | bed.klyː.fɑ |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -an</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A bed-chamber, closet</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. cubile hominis, cubiculum)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">infra in cubiculum tuum</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Gang into ðīnum bedclȳfan</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Mt. Bos. 6, 6)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="fintan" d:title="fintan">
		<body>
			<h1>fintan<span class="pron"> | fin.tɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">of an action</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. consequentia)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">when he sees the consequence of treachery</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Ðonne he ðæs fācnes fintan sceāwaþ</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Exon. 83b; Th. 315, 17; Mōd. 32: Exon. 74b; Th. 278, 31; Jul. 606)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="wundor-weorold" d:title="wundor-weorold">
		<body>
			<h1>wundor-weorold<span class="pron"> | wun.dor.we͜o.rold |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>feminine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -e</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">The wondrous world</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-oe">Geond ðās wundor-woruld</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Exon. Th. 421, 12; Rä. 40, 17)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="hwāstrian" d:title="hwāstrian">
		
		<body>
			<h1>hwāstrian<span class="pron"> | xwɑː.stri.ɑn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>verb</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">past: sg: -ede</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">To whisper, murmur, mutter</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">adversum me susurrabant omnes inimici mei</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Āgēn mē hwǣstredun ealle fȳnd mine</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Ps. Lamb. 40, 8)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">murmurabant</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Huǣstredon</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Mt. Kmbl. Lind. 20, 11: Lk. Skt. Lind. 19, 7: Jn. Skt. Lind. 6, 41, 61)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">murmurari</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Huǣstria</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (6, 43)</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">murmurantem</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Huǣstrende</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (7, 32)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:hwisprian" class="xref-target">hwisprian</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:hwistlian" class="xref-target">hwistlian</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="-lǣcung" d:title="-lǣcung">
		<body>
			<h1>-lǣcung<span class="pron"> | læː.kung |</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ed-lǣcung" class="xref-target">ed-lǣcung</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:efen-lǣcung" class="xref-target">efen-lǣcung</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:gedyrst-lǣcung" class="xref-target">gedyrst-lǣcung</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:gelōm-lǣcung" class="xref-target">gelōm-lǣcung</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:geþrīst-lǣcung" class="xref-target">geþrīst-lǣcung</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:neā[h]-lǣcung" class="xref-target">neā[h]-lǣcung</a>, <a href="x-dictionary:r:riht-lǣcung" class="xref-target">riht-lǣcung</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="hand-leān" d:title="hand-leān">
		<body>
			<h1>hand-leān<span class="pron"> | xɑnd.læ͜ɑːn |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>neuter noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A reward, recompense given by the hand, retribution</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-en">let us consider what recompense we have to offer him</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Uton wē geþencean hwylc handleān wē him forþ tō berenne habban</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Blickl. Homl. 91, 13: Cd. 143; Th. 178, 29; Exod. 19: Beo.Th. 3087; B. 1541: 4195; B. 2094)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="emb-ryne" d:title="emb-ryne">
		<body>
			<h1>emb-ryne<span class="pron"> | emb.ry.ne |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>masculine noun</b>
				</p>
				<p>
					<b class="ending">genitive sg: -es</b>
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>
						<span class="meaning-en">A running round, a course, revolution, anniversary</span>
						<span class="meaning-la"> (Lat. revolūtio, circuĭtus)</span>
					</p>
					<ul class="quotes">
						<li>
							<span class="q-la">quinquennia jam děcem</span>
							<span class="q-oe">Tyn etnbrynas</span>
							<span class="q-cite"> (Glos. Prudent. Recd. 139, 1)</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="xref">See also: <a href="x-dictionary:r:ymb-rene" class="xref-target">ymb-rene</a>
			</p>
		</body>
	</d:entry>
<d:entry xmlns:d="http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng" id="ērra" d:title="ērra">
		
		<body>
			<h1>ērra<span class="pron"> | eːr.rɑ |</span>
			</h1>
