			<h1>tintregung<span class="pron"> | tin.tre.ɣung |</span>
			</h1>
			<div>
				<p>
					<b>noun</b>
				</p>
				<ul class="quotes">
					<li>
						<span class="q-oe">Hē hēt his cwelleras swīðor wītnian þone hālgan wer, ac hī āteōrodon on þǣre tintregunge</span>
						<span class="q-cite"> (Hml. S. 37, 126)</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
